Program          : DRVEC 0.12
Input Data File  : the .pre files
Output File      : e1cprank.out
Model            : VARMA-VECM(2,0), M = 3 series, cointegration rank r = 0..2 (sequential test)
Estimation       : Exact Unconditional Maximum Likelihood, Algorithm AS 311 (Mauricio 1997), xi sequence truncated at 1e-3
Transformation   : VECM to stationary VARMA (Mauricio 2006)
Deterministic    : case 3 -- E[nabla Y2] free, E[W] free
Structure        : F free, Theta absent (q = 0), Sigma free
Series           : invest income cons   (2 in the nabla Y2 block, 1 in Y1)
Sample           : 91 observations from 1960/2, quarterly (raw 92)

=== Sequential LR test for the cointegration rank ===

=== The ladder below the rank: r = 0, from the gate up ===
  rung 0  (F diag, Theta diag, Sigma diag)   logL = 712.4058755304

=== Entry gate: the factorisation contract ===

At r = 0 with diagonal Phi, Theta and Sigma the likelihood factorises,
so the joint fit must equal the sum of the univariate fits exactly.

  univariate 1 (p=2, q=0)   logL =     155.3154839699
  univariate 2 (p=2, q=0)   logL =     274.9073355577
  univariate 3 (p=2, q=0)   logL =     282.1830560028
                                 sum  =     712.4058755304
                                 joint=     712.4058755304
  (both sides untruncated; the fit's own logL, xi truncated at 1e-03, is 712.4058755304)

  crossing identity (joint - sum) = -9.095e-13   (tolerance 1.0e-06)   VERIFIED
  rung 1  (F diag, Theta diag, Sigma free)   logL = 732.7082500999
  rung 2  (F free, Theta free, Sigma free)   logL = 743.6141202534

